                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.24/30</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Russia</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Francis</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-03-26T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 26, 1918,
                                5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>26. What action taken regarding the Department’s 2064, February 14, 4 p.m.,
                    concerning funds for military mission?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Lansing</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
